 "brief": "The Arab League and Organisation of Islamic Cooperation held a joint ministerial meeting on Jerusalem during high-level proceedings of the UN General Assembly's 81st session in New York, Shehab Wire reported. The session brought together officials from multiple countries to discuss protection of the city.\n\nThe organizations warned against attempts to alter Jerusalem's identity, according to the reported discussion agenda. The meeting took place on the margins of the General Assembly's ongoing work.",
